@startuml CU-12
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (catálogo)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /catalog" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CatalogService / garment, category, image, variant" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: consultar prendas disponibles
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /catalog?page=&size=
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_catalog(db, page, size)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: prendas + categoría + variantes + stock
Ctrl --> UI : 5: Page[CatalogItemRead]
UI --> Cli : 6: grid de resultados

Cli -> UI : 7: paginar el catálogo
UI -> Ctrl : 8: GET /catalog?page=N&size=M
Ctrl -> Model : 9: list_catalog(db, page, size)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: siguiente página
Ctrl --> UI : 11: Page[CatalogItemRead]
UI --> Cli : 12: más prendas

@enduml